    "28": {
      "date": "2026-10-16",
      "edition": "Friday 16 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Squad news",
          "heading": "Jake White names three uncapped players in Fiji's first squad for Japan",
          "body": "New Fiji head coach Jake White has named his first Test squad, 28 players for the Centennial Test against Japan, and three of them are uncapped: Apolosi Vuniyawa, Kavekini Boselawa and Nacani Boginisoko. White has picked 16 forwards and 12 backs, without some European-based players. Fiji look to gain a measure of revenge on Eddie Jones' side after losing to them in last month's Pacific Nations Cup final, and the Test starts their preparations for November's matches against France, Ireland and Italy."
        },
