          "heading": "Italy concede 28.9 points a game across their last 11 matches",
          "body": "Italy's defensive record over their last 11 matches is the figure that stands out. They conceded 318 points in that run, an average of 28.9 a game, and scored 190 in the same stretch. Their biggest win in the window was a 34-19 home victory over Chile in November 2025. Their next opponent is South Africa, so the conceding column is the one to watch."
