          "heading": "Wales trio Wainwright, Cracknell and Reffell start all Leicester's league games",
          "body": "Wainwright, Cracknell and Reffell have started all three of Leicester's league games, a combination that had never played together before. Wins over Newcastle and Gloucester and a narrow defeat to Saracens have come with Wainwright and Reffell on the flanks and Cracknell at number eight. Wainwright, with 70 Wales caps, set up winger Gabriel Hamer-Webb for a try against Saracens on his debut. Tandy names his autumn squad next week, and this back row is making its case."
