          "body": "Sir John Kirwan, speaking on the Rugby Rivals podcast, believes the Wallabies have a \"big problem\" on their bench before Saturday's second Bledisloe Test in Sydney. His view is that the All Blacks' replacements lifted the level after the sides were level at 14-14 at the break in Auckland, while Australia's depth looked short in a 50-19 defeat. Kirwan doubted whether the squad has enough depth, and the Wallabies named a vastly inexperienced eight among their replacements last week."
